     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"149.11 \\times {10^{ - 4}}\"></span></p>\n<p>When you move the decimal point two places to the right, 149.11 becomes 14,911. Because the number became larger, you need to decrease the exponent by 2. Change the exponent from –4 to –6.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"14911.0 \\times {10^{ - 6}}\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"14,911.0 \\times {10^{ - 6}}\">14,911.0 \\times {10^{ - 6}}</span>"
    }
